  dialogueLines:
  - The battery cooling system keeps the cells from overheating. If it fails, the
    battery temperature rises fast and can damage the whole pack
  - "Looks like there\u2019s a short circuit in the cooling unit. Take this\nwrench
    and tighten the connections so we can get the system running again"
  - Press H to hide the car's body . Press L if you want to reveal the pipes.
